        {
          "id": 2214264756,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "namespaces require [wsutil/filesystem.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/wsutil/filesystem.c).  \nNot that `dumpcap` is fragile but it doesn't need extra stuff?  \n  \nb4ce3525 added the \"(Wireshark)\" to program names.  \nIs that a feature? Does `dumpcap` need that added?",
