    {
      "id": "fe9d2df0480398df0f963d3a1100a6d91e2bba37",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2214702197,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is the underlying problem here that the underlying concept should really be not the \"configuration namespace\", i.e. the path names in which files such as configuration files are stored, but the \"application type\" or \"application class\", e.g. is the program that's running a packet-processing program that's part of the Wireshark suite or a log-processing program that's part of the Stratoshark suite? See, for example, the comment in wsutil/filesystem.c:\n\n```\n/*\n * Application configuration namespace. Used to construct configuration\n * paths and environment variables.\n * XXX We might want to use the term \"application flavor\" instead, with\n * \"packet\" and \"log\" flavors.\n */\nenum configuration_namespace_e {\n    CONFIGURATION_NAMESPACE_UNINITIALIZED,\n    CONFIGURATION_NAMESPACE_WIRESHARK,\n    CONFIGURATION_NAMESPACE_STRATOSHARK\n};\n```\n\nPerhaps:\n\n- we *should* use the term \"application flavor\";\n- we should move the code that sets and gets the application flavor out of wsutil/filesystem.[ch] to new wsutil/app_flavor.[ch] files;\n- we should have the call to set the flavor take a flavor enum value as an argument rather than checking the name of the executable;\n- we should have the code that cares about the application flavor - for now, the code that determines configuration file paths and the code would determine whether to use \"Wireshark\" or \"Stratoshark\" as the app suite name - call the wsutil/app_flavor.[ch] routine that returns the flavor enum.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-11-16T22:39:55.979Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-11-18T21:29:34.054Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 343443347,
